/**
 * Maine Sales Agent Course (55 clock hours) — module question bank.
 *
 * Two figures in this file are the REGULATOR'S and not this school's, which is the opposite of the
 * Virginia and Michigan banks and must not be blurred:
 *
 *   75 percent  the passing grade, from the Commission's rules and its published Sales Agent Course
 *               guideline, recorded in maine/official-sources.md.
 *   3,000 / 300 the instruction and assessment minute split, from the same guideline, which caps
 *               assessment time at 10 percent of course length.
 *
 * These items are NOT the final examination. The Commission's outline prescribes three quizzes of
 * twenty items and a final of eighty, and those banks are held in maine/assessments/ and are not
 * published to students. The items here gate progression through a module and are visible by design.
 *
 * Each of the nine modules carries one applied item, five engagement items, and five remediation
 * items. The correct answer is authored at index 0 for legibility and is permuted deterministically
 * per item id at delivery, so a recorded selection keeps its meaning permanently.
 *
 * Every Maine section cited was read directly from legislature.maine.gov on 2026-08-20 and is
 * recorded in maine/regulatory/primary-text-readings.md. Where a rule has not been read — the VRLTA
 * figures, the records retention schedule, the Maine Human Rights Act protected-class list — the
 * item asks where the answer lives rather than asking for the answer.
 *
 * Course version 1.0 submission draft — not approved. No Maine sales agent credit is available.
 */

